Title: Unknown Signal
By: Bhaskar Bhattacharya

INT. office room - evening

A man walks into an office room where another person is already standing and waiting for him. They greet each other warmly.

CHIEF
Hello, aayiye janaab. Aap zaroor Watchman honge.

WATCHMAN
Ji, aur aap honge Chief.

CHIEF
Bilkul sahi

They shake hands. Chief signals him to sit.

CHIEF
Please-

Watchman settles down on a chair. Chief sits partially rested on the table next to Watchman.

CHIEF
Department ne Watchman ko bheja hai iska matlab koi bohot serious case hai.

To which Watchman pulls out a small pouch with two pens from his pocket.

WATCHMAN
Case pe aate hain Chief, usse pehle ek chhota sa test karna jaroori hoga.

CHIEF
Hmm... zaroor.

Watchman pulls out a pen from the pouch and places it on the table. The Chief reaches towards it to which Watchman signsl him to stop with a hand wave. Then he looks at the pen and then at the Chief and tells him:

WATCHMAN
(Slow and calculated)
Kis rang ki pen dikh rahi hai aapko?

CHIEF
(Laughs)
Green dikh rha hai janaab.

Watchman lets out a deep sign and says:

WATCHMAN
Baith jaiye Chief, aaj ka din bohot lamba aur mushkil hone waala hai.

CHIEF
Accha?

Chief sits down as well.

WATCHMAN
2 din pehle aapke Observation post ne ek unnatural Muon burst detect kiya tha right?

CHIEF
Hanji, origin uska Pune city ke andar kahin tha, exact location hum traingulate nhi kar sake.

WATCHMAN
Theek usi din Varanasi me bhi same type ka Muon burst detect hua tha. Again location unknown.

CHIEF
How is that even possible?

WATCHMAN
Exactly. Department believes ki ye ek attack tha. Kisi type ka Superweapon use hua hai.

CHIEF
Superweapon? But target kaun tha uska?

WATCHMAN
Target se jyada important hai collateral damage jo uss attack ki wajah se hone waala hai.

CHIEF
What do you mean by jo hone waala hai?

WATCHMAN
Hum jis reality me rehte hain woh Space-Time fracture ho chuka hai.

CHIEF
That makes no sense.

WATCHMAN
Maine aapse poocha tha pen ka colour yaad hai? Jara gaur kijiye pen ki or.

Chief looks at the pen. It is yellow in colour.

CHIEF
Mujhe yaad hai ye pen Green tha.

WATCHMAN
Mere pouch me sirf Blue aur Red pen hai. And maine pouch se Blue pen nikala tha.

Chief looks at the pen again and it is Blue this time.

CHIEF
Kya ho rha hai ye?

Suddenly there is a knock at the wall behind them. They both turn to look at it.

WATCHMAN
Koi hai jo humari baatein sun rha hai.

CHIEF
Actually woh humara Interrogation room hai. Aaj subah security ne ek aadmi ko detain kiya jo somehow station ke andar ghus aaya tha.

WATCHMAN
Mujhe milna hai uss se.

CHIEF
Hmm... aaiye.

They both get up and go to the entrance of the Interrogation room. Chief buzzes the door opens it.

There is a man ziptied or handcuffed to a chair.

CHIEF
Ye hai woh aadmi. Subah hi pakda humne iss ko.

STRANGER
Aapne kahan pakda. Mai toh apni marzi se aaya.

CHIEF
Accha? Sahi hai.

STRANGER
Main entrance se chal ke aaya hu mai. Kuch zaroori baat karni thi aapse.

Suddenly Watchman shots behind him.

WATCHMAN
(Loudly)
Chief!

Chief turns and looks at him.

WATCHMAN
Kisse baat kar rhe ho aap?

CHIEF
Ye jo chair pe baitha hua hai aadmi. Usi se.

WATCHMAN
Yahan koi nhi hai Chief.

CHIEF
(Pointing at the man)
Yahan chair ke upar banda baitha hai. Koi nhi hai matlab?

WATCHMAN
Yahan hum dono ke alawa aur koi nhi hai Chief.

Chief gives a confused look at Watchman and then looks at the chair where stranger is tied. This time he is not there on the chair.